  ▌ keyway list [query]... [options]

  List the hosts that match a query. With --recent the hosts you connected to
  last come first, as in the picker.

  Options:
       --json    Output as JSON
       --recent  Put the hosts you connected to last first, as the picker does

  Global Options: See `keyway --help`

  Examples:
  List the hosts matching both words
    keyway list new consul

  Print only the host names
    keyway list | cut -f2

  List the hosts as JSON
    keyway list --json
